cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use xsnow, please cite it with the metadata below."
title: "xsnow: a collaborative Python package for parsing and post-processing snow cover simulations"
abstract: >
  xsnow is an open, collaborative Python library for parsing, analyzing, and
  post-processing simulated snow profiles. It wraps xarray-based data models,
  domain-specific workflows, and an extension framework to support both
  operational avalanche forecasting and research.
